        <mxCell id="foot" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666666;" value="Solid = live in code; dashed / grey = designed, built-but-off, or partial (marker in label: (planned)=spec/design only, (built, off)/(gated)=code-complete but disabled, (partial)=partly shipped). PRAMANA is SOX single-tenant v1 - much of Certification, bulk assign, SAML, GDPR erasure and 5-of-6 frameworks are spec, not runtime. All three apps share the wegofwd-llm seam; PRAMANA + kathai-chithiram also share wegofwd-video (ADR-026); Mentible adds shared wegofwd-secure / wegofwd-help - see shared_library.drawio. Mentible has repositioned to an SME expert-validation studio (ADR-037) - now BUILT (capture→validate→share, expert approval, publish→library, studio theming; verified vs Mentible origin/main e13f10b); its per-user private hosted library (ADR-033) is still designed; see apps_features.drawio. AGASTYA (cyber, reference impl - mock data, 108 tests) and Atri Sangam (GPS/PNT, alpha v0.1.8) are the no-LLM line - deterministic, no shared content engine. Verified against each repo README/docs/ADRs/source, 2026-09-01 (Mentible ADR-037 Studio re-verified vs origin/main)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1900" x="40" y="1980" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
